                Oh no! Looks like there's a break in the chain!                 
                                                                                
     This project is attached to a remote bd serve over HTTP (bd connect).      
   Perles reads beads from a Dolt SQL server and can't use the http backend.    
                                                                                
      Run perles in the workspace that bd serve is serving, or detach this      
                     one and restore its previous backend:                      
                               bd connect --clear                               
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                Press q to quit                                 
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                